# Normalize line endings for all text files to LF in the working tree, on every platform.
# Without this, a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true, the GitHub Actions windows-latest
# runner default) rewrites text files to CRLF, which electron-vite copies through into
# out/renderer/index.html largely verbatim — producing a build whose app.asar differs
# byte-for-byte from the Linux build's, which the cross-platform drift gate in release.yml
# (e2e/drift.mjs --require-cross-platform) catches and rejects at publish time.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touched by line-ending normalization.
*.png binary
